              <td style="padding: 11px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Excellent (ZDDP, MoS₂, S-P EP packages)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="background: var(--bg);">
              <td style="padding: 11px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border); font-weight: 600;">Operating temperature</td>
              <td style="padding: 11px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">−20°C to 150°C (ester/PAO); −5°C to 100°C (WMO)</td>
              <td style="padding: 11px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">−40°C to 200°C+ (PAO, ester, fluorinated synthetic)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="background: var(--surface);">
              <td style="padding: 11px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border); font-weight: 600;">Grease thickener options</td>
